# Script Node Panel Simplification

## Context

Now that Ideation Studio exists for brainstorming hooks, titles, and descriptions, the Script Node panel no longer needs all that configuration. It should be simplified to just reference saved content or configure runtime generation.

**Before:** 9 tabs (Format, Structure, Hooks, Titles, Description, Tags, Tone, AI Model, Advanced)

**After:** 3 tabs (Content, Generation, Advanced)

