## Implementation Steps

### Step 1: Backup Current Panel
- Copy current ScriptPanel.tsx to ScriptPanel.old.tsx (for reference)

### Step 2: Create New Panel Structure
```
src/components/nodes/panels/script/
├── ScriptPanel.tsx          # Main panel with 3 tabs
├── ContentTab.tsx           # Tab 1: Content sources
├── GenerationTab.tsx        # Tab 2: Generation settings  
├── AdvancedTab.tsx          # Tab 3: Advanced options
└── index.ts
```

### Step 3: Update Store
- Update `nodeConfigStore.ts` with new `ScriptNodeConfig` interface
- Remove old fields (hookStyles, hookCount, titleCount, etc.)
- Add new fields matching schema above

### Step 4: Build ContentTab
- Radio buttons for each content type (Hook, Title, Description)
- ContentPicker integration (reuse from Elements)
- Template editor for description
- Tags section with auto-generate toggle
- "Open Ideation Studio" link at bottom

### Step 5: Build GenerationTab
- Archetype dropdown
- Duration dropdown
- Model radio buttons
- Temperature slider
- Channel Bible checkbox with link to settings

### Step 6: Build AdvancedTab
- Section checkboxes
- Custom instructions textarea
- Output options checkboxes

### Step 7: Wire Up ContentPicker
- Filter by type (hook, title, description)
- Show selected content preview
- Clear button to deselect

### Step 8: Update Script Node Execution
- Check content source for each piece
- If 'library': fetch from Content Library by ID
- If 'template': use template with variable replacement
- If 'generate': run AI generation with config

