## ContentPicker Component

If not already built, create a reusable ContentPicker:

```typescript
interface ContentPickerProps {
  type: 'hook' | 'title' | 'description' | 'intro' | 'cta';
  value?: string;           // Selected content ID
  onChange: (id: string | null, content?: ContentItem) => void;
  placeholder?: string;
}
```

**Behavior:**
1. Shows dropdown/button to open picker modal
2. If value is set, shows preview of selected content
3. Picker modal lists content filtered by type
4. Search within modal
5. Click to select, returns ID and content object
6. Clear button to deselect

