## Warnings

### Don't Do These Things

❌ **Don't keep the old 9-tab structure** — It's redundant now

❌ **Don't duplicate Ideation Studio features** — Just link to it

❌ **Don't show generation options when using library content** — They're not relevant

❌ **Don't forget to handle missing content** — If saved content is deleted, handle gracefully

❌ **Don't make ContentPicker inline** — Use a modal/dropdown to save space

### Watch Out For

⚠️ **Content Library might be empty** — Show helpful message + Ideation Studio link

⚠️ **Channel Bible might not exist** — Show setup link, don't break

⚠️ **Template variables** — Validate they exist in the template

⚠️ **Migration** — Existing configs might have old schema, handle gracefully